:: Fishing Seagull Shoo
<<effects>>
<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	갈매기는 <span class="green">깜짝 놀라 물러서더니</span>, 바다 위로 날아간다.
	<br><br>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		아주 작은 물고기라, 통째로 입에 넣을 수 있을 것 같다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
		<<link [[fishStowLabel($fishingHookedFish)|Fishing Beach Wait]]>>
			<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
			<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
			<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Beach Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
		<<link [[fishStowLabel($fishingHookedFish)|Fishing Pier Wait]]>>
			<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
			<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
			<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Pier Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
		<<link [[fishStowLabel($fishingHookedFish)|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>>
			<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
			<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
			<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[물고기를 먹는다|Fishing Coast Path Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	발버둥 쳐 보았지만, 갈매기가 쏜살같이 날아와 손에서 물고기를 <span class="red">채어가며</span> 날아가 버린다.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
		<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
		<<link [[다음|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
		<<link [[다음|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Seagull Give
<<effects>>
You hold the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> out. The seagull eyes it, then takes it from your hand and flies off.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

/* =================================== */
/* ===== Minigame Result Widgets ===== */
/* =================================== */

:: Widgets Fishing Seagull Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingSeagullCatch">>
	<<set _fish to _args[0]>>
	<<set _fishingLocation to _args[1]>>
	<<set _fishNameKr to setup.foodstuff[_fish.type].name>>
	<<effects>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.seagullSteal to true>>

	<<if _fish.size gte 120>>
		A seagull circles overhead, spots the <<= fishDisplayName(_fish.type)>>, and lands beside you. It clamps its beak onto the fish and heaves. Nothing moves. It heaves again, harder, and still the fish doesn't budge. The seagull gives it one last look, then waddles away with the energy of a creature that has decided this never happened.
		<br><br>

		<<if _fishingLocation is "fishingBeach">>
			<<link [[fishStowLabel(_fish)|Fishing Beach Wait]]>>
				<<run fishStow(_fish)>>
				<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
				<<if baitShopWants(_fish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
				<<endevent>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<elseif _fishingLocation is "fishingPier">>
			<<link [[fishStowLabel(_fish)|Fishing Pier Wait]]>>
				<<run fishStow(_fish)>>
				<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
				<<if baitShopWants(_fish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
				<<endevent>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<<elseif _fishingLocation is "fishingCoastPath">>
			<<link [[fishStowLabel(_fish)|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>>
				<<run fishStow(_fish)>>
				<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
				<<if baitShopWants(_fish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
				<<endevent>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[놓아준다|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		A seagull lands nearby and eyes your <<= fishDisplayName(_fish.type)>>. After a moment it hops forward and lunges for your catch.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[쫓아낸다|Fishing Seagull Shoo]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty -100 200>>
		<br>
		<<link [["Let it have the " + fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)|Fishing Seagull Give]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
